        "description": "Nozomi Kaminashi is the main protagonist of Keijo!!!!!!!!. She was a student at Setouchi Keijo Training School. She previously resided in Room 309 before being promoted to the Elite Class.\n\n~!Upon graduating from Setouchi, Nozomi officially becomes a B-Rank Keijo player, affiliated with the Kansai's Hyougo Branch. After her winless start in the professional world of Keijo, Nozomi tries to seek a mentor to guide her. After meeting [Sumire Sakuragi](https://anilist.co/character/271330/Sakuragi-Sumire), Nozomi asks Sumire to become her mentor. Although Sumire initially refused, Sumire is later willing to become soeur with her.!~\n\n~!After her match with [Sayaka Miyata](https://anilist.co/character/90194/Miyata-Sayaka), Nozomi is able to advance to the A-Rank. Sometime later, Nozomi and Sayaka start to stay in the Garden Worth, a lodging for Keijo players, where they reunite with [Hanabi Kawai](https://anilist.co/character/121783/Kawai-Hanabi) and [Saya Kogatana](https://anilist.co/character/136254/Kogatana-Saya).!~",
